WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.960 --> 00:00:08.800
I think the libraries can help communicate knowledge about what is happening.

00:00:08.820 --> 00:00:11.080
They can be the bank for the climate change.

00:00:11.080 --> 00:00:20.340
They can create communication as well as images and translate the scientific language for the citizens to understand.

00:00:20.340 --> 00:00:22.080
However, I don’t think they can do this by themselves.

00:00:22.080 --> 00:00:29.060
They need to form an alliance with artists in a broad sense; actors, sculptors, painters.

00:00:29.920 --> 00:00:34.880
People who are used to tell stories using a whole other language than they speak in the libraries.

00:00:35.420 --> 00:00:39.620
I believe we need to use an artistic, symbolic language to make people comprehend

00:00:39.620 --> 00:00:43.200
the tremendous changes that are currently happening to the Earth,

00:00:43.200 --> 00:00:51.820
as well as to piece together hope and how to reconstruct a new society, which will not replicate climate change.

00:00:51.900 --> 00:00:54.320
How to get out on the other side of this situation.

